{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29049","headline":"与郑秀才叔侄会送杨秀才昆仲东归 · 许浑","name":"与郑秀才叔侄会送杨秀才昆仲东归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"书劒功迟白发新，异乡仍送故乡人。\n阮公留客竹林晚，田氏到家荆树春。\n雪尽塞鸿南翥少，风来胡马北嘶频。\n洞庭烟月如终老，谁是长杨谏猎臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29049.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29049","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}